---
import type {Route,Content} from '../data/types';
import {photos,byId} from '../data/catalog.mjs';
import Photo from './Photo.astro';import CredentialLogos from './CredentialLogos.astro';
interface Props {route:Route;content:Content;}
const {route,content}=Astro.props;const images=photos(route.page_id);const contact=byId('ST-003');
---
<article class="about-journey"><section class="hero"><div class="wrap"><nav class="breadcrumb" aria-label="Breadcrumb"><a href="/">Home</a><span aria-hidden="true">/</span><span aria-current="page">About MGI</span></nav><div class="hero-grid"><div><p class="eyebrow">About MGI Heating and Air</p><h1>{content.title}</h1><p class="lede">{content.summary}</p><p>It’s the people who make MGI what it is.</p>{contact&&<a class="button" href={contact.canonical_route}>Talk with MGI ↗</a>}</div><Photo image={images[0]} eager caption="There’s a lot to love about home."/></div><CredentialLogos/></div></section>
{content.sections.map((section,i)=><section class:list={['section',{'dark':i===0,'about-canvas':i===2}]}><div class="wrap"><div class="about-intro"><h2>{section.heading}</h2><p>{section.body}</p></div>{i===1&&<div class="about-values">{(section.bullets||[]).map((value,n)=><div><span class="value-icon"><svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.6" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" aria-hidden="true"><path d={['M12 3 4 6v6c0 5 8 9 8 9s8-4 8-9V6l-8-3M8 12l3 3 5-6','M9 18h6m-6 3h6M8 15a7 7 0 1 1 8 0l-1 3H9l-1-3','M5 21V3m0 1h14l-4 5 4 5H5','M9 4H5v17h14V4h-4M9 3h6v4H9V3m-1 11 3 3 5-6','m12 3 3 6 7 1-5 5 1 7-6-3-6 3 1-7-5-5 7-1 3-6','M9 9a3 3 0 1 0 0-6 3 3 0 0 0 0 6m6 0a3 3 0 1 0 0-6M2 21v-4a7 7 0 0 1 14 0v4m3-10a6 6 0 0 1 3 6v4'][n]}/></svg></span><h3>{value.split(':')[0]}</h3><p>{value.slice(value.indexOf(':')+1).trim().replace(/^./,c=>c.toUpperCase())}</p></div>)}</div>}<div class:list={['about-row',{'about-values-story':i===1}]}>{i!==1&&<Photo image={images[i+1]} caption={['Room for the little things.','Stay a little longer.','Time for what matters.'][i]} tilt={i===1?-2:2}/>}<div><h3>{['A team effort, from the office to your home.','Relationships grow through everyday choices.','Listen. Explain. Respect.'][i]}</h3>{i===1?<p>These values set the direction for how we work with homeowners and with one another. A useful explanation, an honest answer, and respect for a person’s decision all matter.</p>:<ul>{(section.bullets||[]).map(t=><li>{t}</li>)}</ul>}{i===2&&<p class="about-ownership">MGI Heating and Air is the residential HVAC brand of MGI Mechanical Services Inc, owned by Mike Regula and based in Berthoud, Colorado.</p>}{byId(i===2?'ST-006':'ST-005')&&<a href={i===2?'/service-area/':'/services/'}>{i===2?'Explore service areas':'Explore services'} ↗</a>}</div>{i===1&&<Photo image={images[i+1]} caption="Stay a little longer."/>}</div></div></section>)}
<section class="section dark"><div class="wrap"><div class="about-intro"><h2>Let’s get your home back on track.</h2><p>Start with your concern. You do not need to know which part is causing it.</p></div><div class="about-row"><div><h3>Make room for life at home.</h3><p>Tell MGI what changed or what you are planning. Ask about the work, your address, and the next step.</p>{contact&&<a class="button light" href={contact.canonical_route}>Contact MGI ↗</a>}</div><Photo image={images[4]} caption="Back to your kind of day."/></div></div></section></article>
<style>.about-intro{text-align:center;margin-bottom:40px}.about-intro h2,.about-intro p{max-width:none}.about-row{display:grid;grid-template-columns:1fr 1fr;gap:72px;align-items:center}.about-row li{padding:14px 0}.about-row h3{font-size:30px}.about-ownership{font-size:14px;border-top:1px solid #bcc6bb;margin-top:24px;padding-top:20px}.about-values{display:grid;grid-template-columns:repeat(3,1fr);gap:24px;margin-bottom:64px}.about-values>div{padding:28px;background:#f1f3ec;border-radius:14px;border-top:3px solid #afc34f}.about-values h3{font-size:28px;margin:18px 0 12px}.about-values p{margin:0;font-size:16px}.value-icon{display:grid;place-items:center;width:60px;height:60px;background:#afc34f;color:var(--teal);border-radius:50%}.value-icon :global(svg){width:30px;height:30px}.about-values-story{padding-top:12px}.about-canvas{background:#f1f3ec}.eyebrow{font-size:13px;text-transform:uppercase;font-weight:700;letter-spacing:.06em}.about-row a{display:inline-block;padding:12px 0}.about-row a.button{padding:16px 24px}@media(max-width:767px){.about-values{grid-template-columns:1fr;gap:16px;margin-bottom:40px}.about-row{grid-template-columns:1fr;gap:36px}}</style>
